DESCRIPTION >
    Events: full recent event list with optional event_type/source/date-range/
    search filters (events explorer table). Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/events.js:22-137
    (queryName 'events_latest') — flagged unassigned in the prior batch's
    census, closed here as a plain distinct_id read (identity rule #19a:
    distinct_id selected + used in the search filter, canonical stitching
    key, no argMin/argMax).
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id ->
    site_id, event -> event_type, properties.page_url -> page_url,
    properties.referrer -> referrer, properties.ai_source -> ai_source,
    properties.device_type -> device_type, properties.country -> country,
    properties.utm_source/utm_medium/utm_campaign/utm_content/utm_term ->
    typed columns, properties.gclid/fbclid/msclkid/ttclid/gbraid/wbraid/
    li_fat_id/li_fatid/twclid/dclid/snapclid/pclid/sccid/ko_click_id -> typed
    columns, properties.first_touch_source/first_touch_medium/
    first_touch_campaign -> typed columns, properties.conversion_type ->
    conversion_type, properties.conversion_value -> conversion_value (typed
    Float64 DEFAULT 0), properties.ingestion_method -> ingestion_method,
    properties.browser_name -> browser_name.
    JSON-BAG FIELDS HIT (flagged): properties.is_conversion, ref_param,
    source_param, via_param, browser_version, os_name, os_version, utm_id,
    st_campaign_id, st_adgroup_id, st_ad_id, st_target_id, st_network,
    st_device, st_matchtype — all in §2.6's bag list, read via
    JSONExtractString(properties, '<key>'). `properties AS raw_properties`
    ported as-is (already the full bag column, no extraction needed).
    OPTIONAL FILTERS ported as Tinybird `{% if defined(...) %}` blocks,
    matching the source's conditional WHERE-array building exactly:
    event_type_filter (event_type = X), source_filter (lower/COALESCE OR
    across utm_source/first_touch_source/ai_source — all typed, so COALESCE
    still applies to genuine NULLs same as before), date_from_ts/date_to_ts
    (full boundary strings, not string-interpolated, matching prior-batch
    convention), search_filter (LIKE OR across event_type/distinct_id/
    page_url/referrer/utm_source/utm_medium/utm_campaign/ai_source/
    conversion_type/ingestion_method — all typed columns).
    LIMIT: source clamps `limit` to [1,500] default 100 in JS
    (clampLimit()) before interpolating — that clamp is NOT reproducible in
    template SQL, so the caller MUST apply the same [1,500]/default-100 clamp
    before passing `limit_val`; this pipe does not re-clamp.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.
    DEPLOY FIX (tb --cloud deploy --check, ST_Staging v4.6.4): date/datetime
    params were declared String(param, required=True) then wrapped in
    toDateTime(...) — that combination failed with CANNOT_PARSE_DATETIME
    under --check's '__no_value__' placeholder injection (a non-date string
    toDateTime() can't parse). Fixed by declaring the param itself as
    DateTime(...) (matching the already-shipped Phase 4 pipes' proven
    pattern) and dropping the now-redundant toDateTime(...) wrapper — no
    SQL/filter logic changed, only the param type. Re-validated via
    tb --cloud sql with real values post-fix; parity held (see batch
    dispatch report).

NODE events_latest_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        event_type,
        timestamp,
        distinct_id,
        page_url,
        referrer,
        ai_source,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'is_conversion') AS is_conversion,
        device_type,
        country,
        utm_source,
        utm_medium,
        utm_campaign,
        utm_content,
        utm_term,
        gclid,
        fbclid,
        msclkid,
        ttclid,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'ref_param') AS ref_param,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'source_param') AS source_param,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'via_param') AS via_param,
        first_touch_source,
        first_touch_medium,
        first_touch_campaign,
        conversion_type,
        conversion_value,
        ingestion_method,
        browser_name,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'browser_version') AS browser_version,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'os_name') AS os_name,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'os_version') AS os_version,
        gbraid,
        wbraid,
        li_fat_id,
        li_fatid,
        twclid,
        dclid,
        snapclid,
        pclid,
        sccid,
        ko_click_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'utm_id') AS utm_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_campaign_id') AS st_campaign_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_adgroup_id') AS st_adgroup_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_ad_id') AS st_ad_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_target_id') AS st_target_id,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_network') AS st_network,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_device') AS st_device,
        JSONExtractString(properties, 'st_matchtype') AS st_matchtype,
        properties AS raw_properties
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      {% if defined(event_type_filter) %}
      AND event_type = {{ String(event_type_filter, required=True) }}
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(source_filter) %}
      AND (
        lower(COALESCE(toString(utm_source), '')) = {{ String(source_filter, required=True) }}
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(first_touch_source), '')) = {{ String(source_filter, required=True) }}
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(ai_source), '')) = {{ String(source_filter, required=True) }}
      )
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(date_from_ts) %}
      AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from_ts, '1970-01-01 00:00:00') }}
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(date_to_ts) %}
      AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to_ts, '1970-01-01 00:00:00') }}
      {% end %}
      {% if defined(search_filter) %}
      AND (
        lower(toString(event_type)) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(toString(distinct_id)) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(page_url), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(referrer), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(utm_source), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(utm_medium), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(utm_campaign), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(ai_source), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(conversion_type), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
        OR lower(COALESCE(toString(ingestion_method), '')) LIKE concat('%', {{ String(search_filter, required=True) }}, '%')
      )
      {% end %}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT {{ Int32(limit_val, 100) }}

TYPE endpoint
